Subject: [PATCH] feat(api): expose a fixed checked execution-stack query

Register one trusted scalar runtime operation through the existing function machinery. Reject unsupported backends at construction; do not offer arbitrary callbacks a way to bypass host-stack isolation. Requires the matching VM patch.

Base: published wasmer-7.2.1 crate, apply from its crate root with git apply.
Experimental candidate; not a merged upstream change.

diff --git a/src/backend/sys/entities/function/mod.rs b/src/backend/sys/entities/function/mod.rs
